flowchart LR
  accTitle: NutsNews Grafana Cloud observability hardening
  accDescr {
    Draft application, worker, backend, and VPS sources prepare bounded metrics and normalized
    logs. Protected inputs, Environment policy, the synthetic cadence choice, GitOps apply, and
    retained live evidence are all still required before the rollout is complete.
  }
  subgraph Producers["Telemetry producers"]
    Web["Web and content signals"]
    Workers["Eight shadow worker services\nand RabbitMQ"]
    Backend["Backend API, PostgreSQL,\nsync relay and Caddy"]
    VPS["VPS host, systemd,\ndocker stats and journals"]
  end
  Source["Backend owns deploy, Alloy and outbox; worker repos own service signals;\ninfra owns Grafana; meta repo coordinates"] --> Producers
  Web --> Alloy["Backend and VPS Alloy\nbounded collection"]
  Workers --> Alloy
  Backend --> Alloy
  VPS --> Alloy
  Alloy --> Metrics["Grafana Cloud Metrics"]
  Alloy --> Logs["Grafana Cloud Logs\nnormalized labels"]
  Logs --> Drilldown["Query-time pipeline drilldown\nfield links; no Tempo"]
  Infra["nutsnews-infra draft PR"] --> Prereq["Environment policy, protected inputs\nand synthetic budget decision"]
  Prereq --> Validator["Value-free synthetic validator\nregion, API bounds and quota ceiling"]
  Validator --> Plan["Protected read-only plan\nand drift check"]
  Plan --> PlanEvidence["Read-only evidence\ninputs, dashboards, alerts,\nPrometheus and Loki"]
  Plan --> Review{"Reviewed mutation approved?"}
  Review -->|"No"| Pending
  Review -->|"Yes"| Apply["Protected OpenTofu\nand Ansible apply"]
  Apply --> Grafana["Dashboards, email policies,\nfive synthetics and four SLOs"]
  Apply --> Ownership["Ownership dashboard: backend revision\nand exact identities for all eight workers"]
  Apply --> Capacity["Cadence unresolved: six minutes about 72k,\nor five minutes 86.4k with standing major,\nor source-reviewed threshold change"]
  Metrics --> Grafana
  Logs --> Grafana
  Grafana --> Evidence["Post-apply query report"]
  Grafana --> Canary["Firing and resolved\nemail canary receipts"]
  Grafana --> Drills["Source-wired failure drills\nlive proof pending"]
  Workers --> Structural["Even shadowed: deployed, up 1, scrape under 180s,\nexact identity and readiness series"]
  Structural --> Evidence
  Backend --> Pressure["Outbox age guarded by availability;\nseparate from global feed freshness"]
  Pressure --> Grafana
  Ownership --> Evidence
  Evidence --> Ready{"All required evidence present?"}
  Canary --> Ready
  Drills --> Ready
  Capacity --> Ready
  Ready -->|"No"| Pending["Rollout remains pending"]
  Ready -->|"Yes"| Operate["Operate within free-tier\nand ownership guardrails"]
  Legacy["Legacy nutsnews-worker\nproduction ingestion owner"] --> Operate
  Packages["Contracts and Runtime 1.0 released;\neight worker repins still in progress"] --> Workers
  Readonly["Read-only audit Environment exists,\nbut all four inputs are absent"] --> Prereq
